{"n":93,"ar":["وَ\u003ctajweed class=ham_wasl\u003eٱ\u003c/tajweed\u003e\u003ctajweed class=laam_shamsiyah\u003eل\u003c/tajweed\u003eضُّحَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١\u003c/span\u003e","وَ\u003ctajweed class=ham_wasl\u003eٱ\u003c/tajweed\u003eلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٢\u003c/span\u003e","مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٣\u003c/span\u003e","وَلَلْأَخِرَةُ خَيْ\u003ctajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah\u003eرٌ ل\u003c/tajweed\u003eَّكَ مِنَ \u003ctajweed class=ham_wasl\u003eٱ\u003c/tajweed\u003eلْأُولَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٤\u003c/span\u003e","وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٥\u003c/span\u003e","أَلَمْ يَجِ\u003ctajweed class=qalaqah\u003eدْ\u003c/tajweed\u003eكَ يَتِي\u003ctajweed class=ikhafa\u003eمًا ف\u003c/tajweed\u003eَـَٔـاوَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٦\u003c/span\u003e","وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآل\u003ctajweed class=ikhafa\u003eاًّ ف\u003c/tajweed\u003eَهَدَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٧\u003c/span\u003e","وَوَجَدَكَ ع\u003ctajweed class=madda_obligatory\u003eَا\u003c/tajweed\u003eٓئِل\u003ctajweed class=ikhafa\u003eاً ف\u003c/tajweed\u003eَأَغْنَىٰ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٨\u003c/span\u003e","فَأَ\u003ctajweed class=ghunnah\u003eمّ\u003c/tajweed\u003eَا \u003ctajweed class=ham_wasl\u003eٱ\u003c/tajweed\u003eلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَ\u003ctajweed class=qalaqah\u003eقْ\u003c/tajweed\u003eهَرْ \u003cspan class=end\u003e٩\u003c/span\u003e","وَأَ\u003ctajweed class=ghunnah\u003eمّ\u003c/tajweed\u003eَا \u003ctajweed class=ham_wasl\u003eٱ\u003c/tajweed\u003e\u003ctajweed class=laam_shamsiyah\u003eل\u003c/tajweed\u003eسّ\u003ctajweed class=madda_obligatory\u003eَا\u003c/tajweed\u003eٓئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١٠\u003c/span\u003e","وَأَ\u003ctajweed class=ghunnah\u003eمّ\u003c/tajweed\u003eَا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ \u003cspan class=end\u003e١١\u003c/span\u003e"]}